    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "1. ClipProj I2VA correct connection / 正确连接",
      "pos": [
        820,
        980
      ],
      "size": [
        760,
        340
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 15,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## I2VA必须启用视觉合同\n\n连接顺序：`Load CLIP 8B → ClipProj Apply → ClipProj Audit → H3 Conditioning`。首帧接入Conditioning的`first_frame`，任务保持`I2VA`。由于首帧同时进入VAE关键帧和Qwen3-VL视觉塔，审计器的`has_reference_images`必须为true；不要因为它不是Ref2VA参考图就关掉。矩阵必须是8B 4096→5120的`mmh3-8b-ClipProj-v3.1.safetensors`。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "2. Low-load validated controls / 低负载实测参数",
      "pos": [
        1600,
        980
      ],
      "size": [
        760,
        360
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 16,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 本机真实通过，不是空工作流\n\nRTX 4060 Ti 16GB、256×256、22帧、4 NFE、video/audio shift 12/3、seed 2608228201，8B FP8 + v3.1投影 + FL2VA INT8基模 + EMA Turbo LoRA。完整I2VA生成耗时36.125秒；22帧视频和32kHz双声道音频均生成，视频/音频/容器各严格解码3/3。整卡峰值约15,207.4MiB，最低余量约1,172.6MiB。本结果只证明这条短链路可执行。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "3. Scientific boundary / 科学边界",
      "pos": [
        2380,
        980
      ],
      "size": [
        800,
        380
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 17,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 不等于32B质量无损替换\n\n同seed原生32B机械对照已补：8B/32B耗时36.125/33.718秒，峰值15,207.4/15,591.9MiB；8B本例少约384.5MiB但慢约2.4秒。两路视频SSIM约0.9293、PCM相关约0.8984，首帧锚定SSIM为0.8334/0.8394；这些只说明结果接近，不是质量等价。两路画面都出现了非要求的伪中文字幕样式，且0.917秒短对白尚未人工完整试听或ASR验收。调整到0.7MP前仍需独立验证显存，不得宣传无损替换或通用16GB安全。"
      ]
    }
